Changes made
------------
- Ported a subset of the beef Scope 1 logic (dry-matter intake, enteric methane at 20.7 g CH4/kg DMI,
  manure methane, faecal and urinary nitrogen) from JavaScript to SQL.
- Milk-intake terms set to zero; calves under 200 days excluded and replaced by a cow lactation uplift
  (1 + 0.25 x nursing fraction); standard reference weight fixed at 550 / 700 kg.
- Seasons mapped to financial-year quarters instead of calendar seasons.
- Indirect N2O uses IPCC default volatilisation and leaching fractions, simplified from AIA's handling.
- Constants copied: GWP (CH4 28, N2O 265), manure CH4 emission factors, urine/dung N2O EF, non-irrigated
  pasture fertiliser EF, leaching fraction, state electricity Scope 2 factors, purchased-cattle factors.
- Not ported: savannah burning, vegetation (FullCAM) sequestration, feed purchases, dairy/sheep modules.

